  "strings": {
    "Statement of Purpose": "宗旨声明",
    "No. KCTS/2027/A": "编号:KCTS/2027/A",
    "Why this summit exists": "本次峰会存在的原因",
    "Kenya grows more tea than almost anyone. It earns less from it than it should. This is a three-day attempt to change that in one specific direction.": "肯尼亚的茶叶产量几乎位居世界前列,但其收益却未达应有水平。这是一次为期三天的尝试,旨在朝一个特定方向改变这一现状。",
    "The Kenya-China Tea Summit is a landmark international platform designed to deepen trade, investment, innovation and cultural cooperation between Kenya and China within the tea value chain. It runs in Nairobi from 21–23 April 2027.": "Kenya-China Tea Summit是一个具有里程碑意义的国际平台,旨在深化肯尼亚与中国在茶叶价值链领域的贸易、投资、创新和文化合作。峰会将于2027年4月21日至23日在Nairobi举行。",
    "The problem it is convened around": "峰会针对的问题",
    "Kenya is one of the world's largest tea exporters by volume. It is not one of the largest earners. The tea leaves the country in bulk, is blended and branded somewhere else, and the margin is captured somewhere else too. Analysts have put it plainly: Kenya exports more tea than China and Sri Lanka, and earns less for it, held back by bulk sales, a narrow product range and limited market diversity.": "肯尼亚是世界上按产量计最大的茶叶出口国之一,但并非收益最高的国家之一。茶叶以散装形式离开该国,在其他地方进行拼配和品牌包装,利润也在其他地方获取。分析师直言不讳地指出:肯尼亚的茶叶出口量超过中国和斯里兰卡,但收益却更低,受制于散装销售、产品范围狭窄和市场多样性有限。",
    "Ecofin Agency, 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-agriculture/0107-47500-kenya-leads-in-tea-exports-but-trails-in-revenues-compared-to-china-and-sri-lanka\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya leads in tea exports but trails in revenues</a>": "Ecofin Agency,2026年——<a href=\"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-agriculture/0107-47500-kenya-leads-in-tea-exports-but-trails-in-revenues-compared-to-china-and-sri-lanka\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚茶叶出口量领先但收益落后于中国和斯里兰卡</a>",
    "China is where that gap is sharpest, and where it is moving fastest in the wrong direction. Kenyan tea exports to China fell 51% in the first quarter of 2026, to 1.22 million kilogrammes.": "这一差距在中国市场最为明显,且正以错误的方向快速变化。2026年第一季度,肯尼亚对中国的茶叶出口下降了51%,降至1.22百万千克。",
    "The Kenyan Wall Street, Q1 2026 — <a href=\"https://kenyanwallstreet.com/tea-exports-q1-2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya tea exports: Sudan ban and Pakistan's Q1 rise</a>": "The Kenyan Wall Street,2026年第一季度——<a href=\"https://kenyanwallstreet.com/tea-exports-q1-2026\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚茶叶出口:苏丹禁令与巴基斯坦第一季度增长</a>",
    "That decline sits against a national policy pointing the other way. Kenya is targeting close to 200 million kilogrammes of green and orthodox tea by 2030 — a deliberate move away from bulk black — and China has a zero-tariff door open. The Tea Board of Kenya has been working with Chinese partners on processing machinery, energy-efficient technology and, reportedly, an online auction platform.": "这一下降与国家政策的方向背道而驰。肯尼亚的目标是到2030年生产接近200百万千克的绿茶和工夫茶——这是一项刻意摆脱散装红茶的举措——而中国已开放零关税大门。Tea Board of Kenya一直在与中国合作伙伴合作开发加工机械、节能技术,据报道还包括在线拍卖平台。",
    "China Daily, 21 July 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/21/WS6a5ec8f3a310986e2b466594.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Kenya targets bigger tea exports to Chinese market</a>": "China Daily,2026年7月21日——<a href=\"https://www.chinadaily.com.cn/a/202607/21/WS6a5ec8f3a310986e2b466594.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚瞄准扩大对中国市场的茶叶出口</a>",
    "A note on the figures above": "关于上述数据的说明",
    "Every number on this page comes from published trade reporting, is dated, and links to its source. None of it is a claim by the summit or a forecast of what the summit will achieve. It is the context the summit was called in response to.": "本页面上的每一个数字均来自已发布的贸易报告,标注了日期,并链接至其来源。这些数据不是峰会的主张,也不是峰会将实现的预测。这些是召开峰会所回应的背景。",
    "What it is trying to do": "峰会的目标",
    "Six objectives, as set by the secretariat.": "秘书处设定的六项目标。",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Strengthen trade relations</h3>\n      <p>Build durable commercial links between Kenyan tea producers and Chinese buyers.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>加强贸易关系</h3>\n      <p>在肯尼亚茶叶生产商与中国买家之间建立持久的商业联系。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Promote investment</h3>\n      <p>Open Kenya&#39;s tea value chain to Chinese capital across processing, packaging and logistics.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>促进投资</h3>\n      <p>向中国资本开放肯尼亚茶叶价值链的加工、包装和物流环节。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Support innovation</h3>\n      <p>Bring agricultural technology, processing equipment and traceability tools to the people who will use them.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>支持创新</h3>\n      <p>将农业技术、加工设备和可追溯性工具带给将使用它们的人。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Facilitate market access</h3>\n      <p>Shorten the route from a Kenyan estate to a Chinese shelf.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>促进市场准入</h3>\n      <p>缩短从肯尼亚茶园到中国货架的路径。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Foster collaboration</h3>\n      <p>Put producers, policymakers, financiers and researchers in the same rooms for three days.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>促进协作</h3>\n      <p>让生产商、政策制定者、金融家和研究人员在三天内齐聚一堂。</p>\n    </div>",
    "<div>\n      <h3>Promote tea culture</h3>\n      <p>Set Kenya&#39;s tea heritage alongside China&#39;s, as trade and as culture.</p>\n    </div>": "<div>\n      <h3>推广茶文化</h3>\n      <p>将肯尼亚的茶叶传统与中国的茶文化并置,既作为贸易也作为文化。</p>\n    </div>",
    "Who it is for": "峰会面向对象",
